{
  "name": "Superior Draconic Aspect",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>While you are shifted, any hostile creature that starts its turn within 60 feet of you or enters that area for the first time on a turn, must succeed on a Wisdom Saving Throw (DC equal to 8 + your Proficiency bonus + your Constitution modifier) or be Frightened or Charmed by you (your choice) until the end of your next turn. Any affected creature also has Disadvantage on Saving Throws against your breath weapon.</p><p>Once a creature succeeds on this save, it is Immune against this feature for the next 24 hours.</p>",
